{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n \n 久しぶりにきょんこを載せます〜〜\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH6F0HYR5FN0Q9KV4D1BNP1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH6F1GHG63TCD828V37ETWK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH6F2DZSQ26DDWNKJFC9GSN","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH6F3DEV8Q7JN3K5TQDR5PM","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n きょんこの大好きな油そば\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH6F4D1TZ93RJX6X4247VN4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n とツーショットを撮ってるきょんこ\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH6F5G4Z2EYCP83YXYF0TP1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n 油そば食べるきょんこ\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH6F6H6J5E0T5WA0R3KWG8T","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH6F7FXBX1HRDMW40SNGPY2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n 耳をかけるきょんこ\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH6F8FM8SVWZJVPNJPPZ4H8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH6F9DTKVZXT5B58J3Y9CD8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n 結構前にくみちゃんと3人で行きました！\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH6FAHWMWQKDVJB6WH9Y1D4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n ラーメン部の部活に参加するのはこの時が初めてでした！\n \n みんなが好きって言ってた油そばに私は初めて行きました！\n \n \n 私もみんながハマッてる油そばの虜になってしまいました。\n \n 私はみんなの流行に少し遅れていつものってる気がします。\n \n \n 今もひらがなけやきでケータイゲームが流行ってて、私は全然ハマらなかったのですが、絶対ハマらないと思ってきょんこにインストールされられたアプリにハマってしまいました。\n \n みんなに遅れていつも流行にのります。\n \n 興味ないなって思ってたけど、やってみると意外とってあるんですね。\n \n グループ活動で勉強になってることの１つです。\n \n \n \n \n 以上、溜まってたきょんこ報告でした〜〜"}],"source":"archive"}